@startuml US_3_1_5_C2_Impl
title US 3.1.5 - Paginas/formularios autorizados (Implementacao)

node "Browser" {
  component Page as "Página da feature\nex: VesselVisitNotificationsComponent"
  component Guard as "AuthGuard\nverifica data.roles"
  component Filters as "Filtros/Pesquisa\ntexto + datas + estado\n(paging local)"
}

component Auth as "AuthService\nroles ativos"
component Api as "TodoApi\n[Authorize] controllers"
database DB as "PortContext\n(AppUsers, Roles, Domain data)"

Guard --> Auth : verificar role exigida
Page --> Filters : aplicar filtros/pesquisa
Filters --> Api : GET listagem filtrada\npage/pageSize
Page --> Api : GET/POST/PUT\nwithCredentials
Api --> DB : valida role + executa query
Api --> Page : dados ou 403/4xx
Page --> Page : mostra tabelas/forms + toasts (US 3.1.4)

note right of Page
- Prioridade: VVN, Storage Areas,
  Physical Resources, Docks, Vessels,
  Shipping Agents/Representatives
- Listas com filtros/busca conforme Sprint A
end note

@enduml
